    "long_instructions": "## Biography Chatbot\r\n\r\nThis chatbot has been designed to summarize information about historical figures. You can ask it about a historical figure, and it will respond with information about their lives. Let's try to adjust the temperature so the chatbot works as expected.\r\n\r\n### Do This\r\n\r\n1) Update the temperature of the chatbot so it can summarize facts and information about historical figures.\r\n    - **Remember to press the <code style=\"color:white; background-color:#7435b2\">Update</code> button each time you change the temperature!**\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n::: details [**Click here to see example messages to try in this level**]\r\n* Who was Ada Lovelace?\r\n* Who was Jerry Lawson?\r\n* Who was Grace Hopper?\r\n:::\r\n\r\n&nbsp;",
